    <string name="sync_how">How sync works</string>
    <string name="sync_how_body">Daysemble syncs when you open it, about every hour, and a few seconds after you change something. If the same item changed in both places, the most recent edit wins, and the other version is listed under Sync conflicts. Google Tasks has no priority or due time, so those stay on this device. Repeating Google events can be edited as a whole series or have single occurrences deleted; editing just one occurrence isn’t supported yet.</string>
